{
  "id": "xunuo.leguan.sub",
  "name": "乐观专用",
  "author": "許諾",
  "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/icons/leguan.jpg",
  "repo": "https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins",
  "apps": [
    {
      "id": "embypulse_dijia_checkin",
      "name": "乐观每日签到",
      "keys": [
        "embypulse2_session_id",
        "embypulse2_username",
        "embypulse2_password",
        "embypulse2_session_id2",
        "embypulse2_username2",
        "embypulse2_password2",
        "embypulse2_session_id3",
        "embypulse2_username3",
        "embypulse2_password3",
        "embypulse2_accounts"
      ],
      "author": "許諾",
      "repo": "https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins",
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-embypulse2/embypulse_dijia_checkin.js",
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_session_id",
          "name": "账号1 session_id",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "desc": "账号1 的 session_id：打开 https://embyyh.dijia.de/ 自动抓取，或手动粘贴。也可以只填账号密码登录，不用填 session_id"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_username",
          "name": "账号1 账号",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "乐观账号（和 session_id 二选一）"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_password",
          "name": "账号1 密码",
          "val": "",
          "type": "password",
          "desc": "乐观密码"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_session_id2",
          "name": "账号2 session_id",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "desc": "第 2 个乐观账号的 session_id（和账号密码二选一）"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_username2",
          "name": "账号2 账号",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "第 2 个乐观账号"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_password2",
          "name": "账号2 密码",
          "val": "",
          "type": "password",
          "desc": "第 2 个乐观账号的密码"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_session_id3",
          "name": "账号3 session_id",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "desc": "第 3 个乐观账号的 session_id（和账号密码二选一）"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_username3",
          "name": "账号3 账号",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "第 3 个乐观账号"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_password3",
          "name": "账号3 密码",
          "val": "",
          "type": "password",
          "desc": "第 3 个乐观账号的密码"
        },
        {
          "id": "embypulse2_accounts",
          "name": "多账号",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "desc": "多账号：每行一个，填 session_id，或 账号；密码（中文分号隔开），不限个数"
        }
      ],
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/icons/leguan.jpg"
      ],
      "descs_html": [
        "乐观每日签到，每天 09:00 自动签到，奖励 90-130 积分。",
        "用法：先安装下面的 Loon 插件，再在 BoxJs 里填 session_id 或账号密码（二选一）。抓 session_id：装好插件后用 Safari 打开一次乐观网站，等「Cookie 获取成功」的通知；也可以直接粘贴。",
        "账号1/2/3：在 BoxJs 里分别填 session_id 或账号密码；多账号：每行一个，填 session_id 或 账号；密码（中文分号隔开）。",
        "Loon 插件：<a href=\"loon://import?plugin=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-embypulse2/EmbyPulseDijiaCheckin.plugin\">点击安装</a>",
        "详细使用说明（含不用挂梯子的云端签到教程）：<a href=\"https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/blob/main/docs/leguan-guide.md\">点这里查看</a>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gh_secrets_sync",
      "name": "同步Git Secrets",
      "keys": [
        "github_pat",
        "github_repo"
      ],
      "author": "許諾",
      "repo": "https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/icons/gh-secrets.jpg"
      ],
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-gh-sync/github_secrets_sync.js",
      "descs_html": [
        "把 BoxJs 里的乐观账号传到你自己 GitHub 仓库的 Secrets 里，GitHub Actions 每天 09:00 自动签到，不用挂梯子，手机关机也能签。本地 Loon 插件保持不变，两边同时跑，先签到的那个生效。",
        "先 Fork 仓库：<a href=\"https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/fork\">点这里 Fork 到你自己的账号</a>，然后在你自己的 fork 里打开 Actions 页面，点启用。",
        "再创建一个 Token：<a href=\"https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta\">点这里创建 Fine-grained Token</a>，选 Only select repositories → 你 fork 的 loon-plugins，Repository permissions 里 Secrets 选 Read and write，然后把 Token 粘贴到下面的「GitHub Token」，并把「仓库」改成 你的用户名/loon-plugins。",
        "填好后在 Loon 里点这个插件的脚本手动运行一次，就会上传（空着的账号不会上传）。以后账号换了，再运行一次就行。",
        "Loon 插件：<a href=\"loon://import?plugin=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-gh-sync/GitHubSecretsSync.plugin\">点击安装</a>",
        "详细使用说明（含云端签到教程）：<a href=\"https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/blob/main/docs/leguan-guide.md\">点这里查看</a>"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "github_pat",
          "name": "GitHub Token",
          "val": "",
          "type": "password",
          "desc": "在 GitHub 上创建一个 Fine-grained Token，只给 loon-plugins 仓库 Secrets 的读写权限，粘贴到这里，不要发给任何人"
        },
        {
          "id": "github_repo",
          "name": "仓库",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "格式：用户名/仓库名"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
